   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal connectors",
     "texto": [
      "**Par conséquent** (consequently), **en conséquence** (as a result), **c'est pourquoi** (that is why): **Il a plu toute la semaine ; par conséquent, la récolte est perdue** (it rained all week; consequently, the harvest is lost)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Following from",
     "texto": [
      "**En raison de** (due to) and **à la suite de** (following) introduce a cause with a noun: **En raison de la pluie, les prix augmentent** (due to the rain, prices rise)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
